sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User (Owner / Staff)
  participant B as Browser Client
  participant A as Flask Auth Blueprint
  participant DB as MySQL Database

  U->>B: Enter email, password & click Sign In
  B->>A: POST /login (email, password, csrf_token)
  A->>A: Check rate limit in memory
  A->>DB: SELECT user_id, password_hash, role, is_active FROM users WHERE email=?
  DB-->>A: User record
  A->>A: check_password_hash(hash, password)
  alt Valid Credentials & is_active = 1
    A->>A: session.clear(); session['user_id'] = id; session['role'] = role
    A-->>B: 302 Redirect to /dashboard or /home
    B-->>U: Render Role Home Page
  else Invalid Credentials
    A->>A: increment failed attempts
    A-->>B: 200 Render login.html with error flash
    B-->>U: Show error notification
  end
